WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.665 --> 00:00:22.109
Zann, Darb, and Zing landed in a fountain across the street from Venna's campaign headquarters.

2
00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.171
Perda and Gliss appeared nearby a second later.

3
00:00:25.932 --> 00:00:28.694
Immediately several trolls ran out of the headquarters.

4
00:00:29.555 --> 00:00:30.996
"Run!" Zann cried.

5
00:00:31.776 --> 00:00:34.497
The kids quickly outran the trolls and hid in some bushes.

6
00:00:34.517 --> 00:00:38.319
"Should we go back to Teplo's house?"

7
00:00:38.719 --> 00:00:39.839
Gliss said, panting.

8
00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:41.280
Darb nodded.

9
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.381
"I don't think we should zap though.

10
00:00:44.061 --> 00:00:47.623
If there are more trolls out there, we don't want to accidentally zap into them."

11
00:00:47.643 --> 00:00:54.586
"And with Morb back in town, I'm betting there are plenty of trolls wandering around," Perda said grimly.

12
00:00:54.606 --> 00:00:59.388
"When we saw the trolls at the palace, we should have known that Laddno was plotting with Morb,"

13
00:00:59.648 --> 00:01:00.208
Zann said.

14
00:01:01.164 --> 00:01:04.845
"Really? I never would have guessed that," Gliss said.

15
00:01:04.865 --> 00:01:06.626
"It's crazy."

16
00:01:06.646 --> 00:01:11.107
"Shh." Perda took a step out of the bushes to check for trolls.

17
00:01:11.127 --> 00:01:13.067
"Come on, let's go."

18
00:01:14.408 --> 00:01:17.628
When the kids got to Teplo's house, trolls were patrolling the street.

19
00:01:18.469 --> 00:01:21.089
Next the kids tried to go to Zann's parents' lab.

20
00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:24.370
But they had to stop behind another building near the lab.

21
00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:27.031
More trolls were lurking in front of the lab.

22
00:01:27.051 --> 00:01:29.332
"Now where should we go?"

23
00:01:29.792 --> 00:01:30.492
Gliss whispered.

24
00:01:31.448 --> 00:01:34.070
"This can't be a coincidence," Perda said.

25
00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:37.433
"Morb probably sent those trolls out to look for us.

26
00:01:38.134 --> 00:01:39.375
Or for Zann, at least."

27
00:01:40.295 --> 00:01:41.176
Zann gulped.

28
00:01:42.057 --> 00:01:42.837
Was that true?

29
00:01:42.857 --> 00:01:46.700
"We need a place to hide and figure out what to do," he said.

30
00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:47.781
"Follow me.

31
00:01:48.042 --> 00:01:48.862
I think I know a place."

32
00:01:49.803 --> 00:01:52.145
He led the way down one street after another.

33
00:01:52.165 --> 00:01:53.906
"Where are we going?"

34
00:01:54.227 --> 00:01:54.847
Darb asked.

35
00:01:56.088 --> 00:01:56.588
"You'll see."

36
00:01:57.429 --> 00:02:00.752
Zann led his friends into a large park with a playground in the middle.

37
00:02:01.536 --> 00:02:04.277
"I used to play hide-and-seek here all the time when I was little.

38
00:02:04.857 --> 00:02:06.818
And I was always the last one to be found."

39
00:02:07.519 --> 00:02:10.320
He glanced around to make sure no trolls were nearby.

40
00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:15.722
Then he ducked into a large playhouse shaped like a small version of the palace.

41
00:02:15.742 --> 00:02:17.723
"No way, Zann!"

42
00:02:18.063 --> 00:02:18.563
Perda said.

43
00:02:18.583 --> 00:02:21.584
"If a troll looks in here, we'll be trapped!"

44
00:02:22.665 --> 00:02:23.285
"No, we won't."

45
00:02:23.985 --> 00:02:27.047
Zann grinned and ran his hands over the back wall.

46
00:02:27.827 --> 00:02:30.248
Soon he found the secret door he remembered.

47
00:02:30.912 --> 00:02:34.194
Beyond was a small room with a few buckets and rakes.

48
00:02:34.214 --> 00:02:37.195
"Wow." Gliss looked around.

49
00:02:37.215 --> 00:02:40.017
"I never would have guessed this was here!"

50
00:02:40.037 --> 00:02:42.138
"Neither will the trolls."

51
00:02:43.039 --> 00:02:44.940
Zann closed the hidden door behind them.

52
00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:47.981
"We should be safe in here while we figure out what to do."

53
00:02:48.702 --> 00:02:51.783
His smile faded as he realized he had no ideas.

54
00:02:52.624 --> 00:02:54.745
How were they going to stop Morb this time?

55
00:02:54.765 --> 00:02:58.147
"We need to find Wyssa," Perda said.

56
00:02:58.167 --> 00:03:00.168
"She might be our only hope."

57
00:03:00.896 --> 00:03:01.637
Darb nodded.

58
00:03:01.657 --> 00:03:04.479
"But how can we find her if she doesn't want to be found?"

59
00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:06.021
Perda sighed.

60
00:03:06.041 --> 00:03:07.582
"Good question.

61
00:03:08.423 --> 00:03:12.686
I can try my Uniting spell again, but I doubt it will work any better."

62
00:03:12.706 --> 00:03:15.168
"What if she already left Magica?"

63
00:03:15.369 --> 00:03:15.889
Gliss said.

64
00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:17.971
Zann hadn't thought of that.

65
00:03:17.991 --> 00:03:21.514
"I don't think she'd leave," he said slowly.

66
00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:26.138
"She seems to feel responsible for helping Morb reach this level of power."

67
00:03:26.158 --> 00:03:28.360
"True," Gliss said.

68
00:03:29.296 --> 00:03:31.937
"She seemed pretty determined to stop him too."

69
00:03:32.517 --> 00:03:33.077
She frowned.

70
00:03:33.097 --> 00:03:36.838
"At least when those weird beetles in the Far Frontier weren't around.

71
00:03:37.238 --> 00:03:39.459
We never did ask her what those were."

72
00:03:40.499 --> 00:03:42.220
"Never mind that," Darb said.

73
00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:46.681
"If Wyssa is still in Magica, she's probably looking for that new contraption."

74
00:03:46.701 --> 00:03:50.402
"Do you think Morb brought it to First City already?"

75
00:03:50.602 --> 00:03:51.182
Gliss wondered.

76
00:03:51.202 --> 00:03:53.503
"Probably," Zann said.

77
00:03:53.523 --> 00:03:56.464
"I'll bet that's what's giving him so much power."

78
00:03:57.524 --> 00:04:01.107
"If we find that contraption, we might also find Wyssa," Darb said.

79
00:04:01.127 --> 00:04:05.871
"Or at least we could try to destroy the contraption ourselves," Perda said.

80
00:04:05.891 --> 00:04:09.814
"Okay, so where do we look for the contraption?

81
00:04:10.275 --> 00:04:10.895
The palace?"

82
00:04:12.016 --> 00:04:13.657
"Maybe." Gliss shrugged.

83
00:04:13.677 --> 00:04:17.400
"I wish we had the Remote Eye with us."

84
00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:19.162
"Or the guidelink," Perda added.

85
00:04:19.182 --> 00:04:23.725
"That might be able to guide us to a strong source of power like the contraption."

86
00:04:25.087 --> 00:04:26.588
"Forget all that," Zann said.

87
00:04:27.412 --> 00:04:30.653
"How are we going to search without being caught by Morb's trolls?"

88
00:04:31.433 --> 00:04:33.434
They were all silent for a moment, thinking.

89
00:04:34.174 --> 00:04:35.395
Darb was the first to speak.

90
00:04:36.135 --> 00:04:37.115
"Why not the Directory?"

91
00:04:37.415 --> 00:04:37.755
he said.

92
00:04:37.775 --> 00:04:40.396
"Huh?" Zann blinked at him.

93
00:04:40.416 --> 00:04:42.157
"The Directory?"

94
00:04:42.857 --> 00:04:43.617
Darb nodded.

95
00:04:43.637 --> 00:04:47.518
"Morb is pretty busy right now with taking over Magica and everything.

96
00:04:48.099 --> 00:04:50.759
He might not think to block or alter his Directory entry."

97
00:04:52.972 --> 00:04:53.272
Perda gasped.

98
00:04:53.292 --> 00:04:56.793
"The Directory automatically updates everyone's information!"

99
00:04:57.073 --> 00:04:57.653
she exclaimed.

100
00:04:57.673 --> 00:05:00.634
"It'll have Morb's current address!"

101
00:05:01.474 --> 00:05:03.935
Zann grinned and clapped Darb on the shoulder.

102
00:05:03.955 --> 00:05:08.916
"I'm sure that's where Morb keeps his stuff, including that contraption!"

103
00:05:08.936 --> 00:05:10.897
"It's worth a try!"

104
00:05:11.377 --> 00:05:12.537
Gliss snapped her fingers.

105
00:05:13.157 --> 00:05:17.078
The Directory appeared, glowing brightly in the dim little storage room.

106
00:05:18.459 --> 00:05:22.620
"Morb," Zann said, and the Directory zeroed in on a particular entry.

107
00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:27.402
At the top was a picture of a sneering Morb, along with his name.

108
00:05:27.422 --> 00:05:33.504
"Current occupation: Tyrant and usurper," Darb read as Zann scrolled down the page.

109
00:05:33.524 --> 00:05:36.806
"Current residence: the palace in First City.

110
00:05:37.286 --> 00:05:41.188
Previous residence: Number 11 Twisted Branch Avenue, Wormwood."

111
00:05:42.368 --> 00:05:43.088
Perda gasped.

112
00:05:43.108 --> 00:05:44.549
"Of course!

113
00:05:44.569 --> 00:05:48.271
That explains the invisible shield over Wormwood.

114
00:05:48.751 --> 00:05:51.352
It must be there to protect Morb's contraption!"

115
00:05:52.324 --> 00:05:55.466
"I wonder how he got it there from the Far Frontier," Darb said.

116
00:05:55.486 --> 00:05:59.168
"And why would he bring it to Wormwood instead of to the palace?"

117
00:06:00.168 --> 00:06:02.830
Perda shrugged, not seeming too worried about that.

118
00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:07.612
"Maybe he brought it in through the wormhole or something, so it was easier just to leave it

119
00:06:07.652 --> 00:06:08.613
there," she said.

120
00:06:09.653 --> 00:06:10.354
Gliss frowned.

121
00:06:10.374 --> 00:06:13.836
"But there are no wormholes in the Far Frontier."

122
00:06:13.856 --> 00:06:16.357
"Never mind that," Perda said.

123
00:06:16.377 --> 00:06:21.640
"How are we going to get into Wormwood, past that weird, sticky Shield spell?"

124
00:06:22.396 --> 00:06:23.198
Zann grinned.

125
00:06:23.218 --> 00:06:26.404
"You just answered your own question," he told her.

126
00:06:26.424 --> 00:06:29.489
"We can go in through the wormhole!"
